# LabSSO conventions

Read `AGENTS.md` for the full rules. Non-negotiables:

- Default ship (FND-001 + OIDC-001 + LOGIN-001) plus VEN-001 is
  implemented. Do not vendor Origin/Cursor agent-skills. Makefile
  targets that are not implemented must `false`. Overage/SAML/SPA/import/integrator are later.
- Documentation ships with the change. Stale docs are a defect. Do not
  change an architectural invariant without an ADR.
- REST and MCP are adapters over one operation registry. Never implement
  MCP by proxying REST. Never implement REST by calling MCP. Handlers
  must not implement independent business logic.
- Secrets are file refs, never inline in YAML, logs, diffs, MCP
  resources, or audit payloads. Unknown YAML fields reject. The service
  must not write the bootstrap configuration file.
- LabSSO is dest-443 (host TCP 443 → unprivileged container listen).
  No LabNTP time bus. Vendor profiles are path and claim clothes on one
  exact issuer — do not impersonate vendor hostnames. Integrator pin in
  `hilather/mcp-integration-lab` is last.
- Do not flatten Cloud notes or Origin SHAs into README. There is no
  Cloud section in this repo; local desktop uses global agent-hints.
